   <media:title>Giorgio Armani &amp; Kith - 2026 Fall/Winter Fashion Show - Dreams of the Dune</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/Or79iSjp6v8?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i4.ytimg.com/vi/Or79iSjp6v8/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Giorgio Armani &amp; Kith presented the third chapter of their collaboration, bringing together Giorgio Armani’s sartorial vocabulary and Kith’s contemporary approach to the men’s wardrobe.

Inspired by the desert’s stillness and sun-bleached palette, the collection blends earthy tones with fluid silhouettes, deconstructed tailoring and refined natural materials across ready-to-wear, accessories and footwear.

The collection releases Friday, October 16th, at select Giorgio Armani and Kith stores worldwide, as well as online.</media:description>
